<title>SPAIN: TENNIS-RESULTS IN THE MARBELLA TENNIS TOURNAMENT.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-RESULTS IN THE MARBELLA TENNIS TOURNAMENT.</headline>
<dateline>MARBELLA, Spain 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results in the Marbella world series men's tennis tournament on Tuesday.</p>
<p>3-Alberto Berasategui (Spain) beat Carl Uwe Steeb (Germany) 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>Marcos Aurelio Gorriz (Spain) beat 8-Hernan Gumy (Argentina) 6-3 6-2</p>
<p>Galo Blanco (Spain) beat Guillermo Perez Roldan (Argentina) 6-2 6-1</p>
<p>Marcelo Filippini (Uruguay) beat Karim Alami (Morocco) 6-2 7-6 (8-6)</p>
<p>4-Alex Corretja (Spain) beat Nicolas Lapentti (Ecuador) 6-4 7-6 (7-2)</p>
<p>Bernd Karbacher (Germany) beat 1-Alberto Costa (Spain) 6-4 7-5</p>
<p>Franco Esquillari (Italy) beat 5-Carlos Moya (Spain) 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>Carlos Costa (Spain) beat Marcio Martelli (Italy) 6-3 6-1.</p>
</text>
